YAMNet
Copyright 2019 The TensorFlow Authors

This directory contains the YAMNet TensorFlow.js graph model published by
Google for the AudioSet embedding model. The model card lists the weights
under the Apache License, Version 2.0:

https://www.kaggle.com/models/google/yamnet

The model code in training/third_party/yamnet is from the TensorFlow Model
Garden (research/audioset/yamnet), also Apache License 2.0:

https://github.com/tensorflow/models/tree/master/research/audioset/yamnet

TensorFlow.js (vendor/tf.min.js) is Copyright 2024 Google LLC and is
Apache License 2.0.

Google Perch 2.0 (bird-vocalization-classifier) is Apache License 2.0
(https://www.kaggle.com/models/google/bird-vocalization-classifier/tensorFlow2/perch_v2)
but is not bundled. The published artifact is 410.28 MB, which is too large
for a phone browser.
